    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bright & Spacious Three-Bedroom Semi-Detached Family Home\r\n\r\nRedmond Property is delighted to present 46 Lissadel Crescent, a bright and spacious three-bedroom semi-detached family home, ideally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac within the ever-popular Seabury development in Malahide.\r\n\r\nThe property offers generous, well-proportioned accommodation throughout and is ideally suited to modern family living. The accommodation includes three bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from an en-suite, together with a guest W.C. and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nFurther features include oil-fired central heating and double-glazed uPVC windows.\r\n\r\nSeabury is one of Malahide’s most established and sought-after residential developments, offering a mature and convenient setting within easy reach of Malahide Village and its excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and amenities.\r\n\r\nThere is an excellent choice of primary and secondary schools nearby, together with numerous sporting and recreational facilities. Malahide Castle & Gardens, the marina, coastal walks and Malahide Beach are also within convenient reach.\r\n\r\nTransport links are excellent, with regular bus services serving the area and Malahide DART Station providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre. Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50 are also readily accessible.\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION\r\n(Please refer to floor plans for room measurements)\r\n\r\nGround Floor:\r\nEntrance Hall • Guest W.C. • Living Room • Dining Room • Large Extended L-Shaped Kitchen/Breakfast Area\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\nLanding • Three Bedrooms • Main Bedroom En-Suite • Family Bathroom\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\n\r\nTo the front, the property is approached by a private driveway providing off-street parking, complemented by a mature, well-established garden with trees, shrubs and planting, gated side access.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from a private, low-maintenance rear garden, predominantly paved and complemented by mature shrubs and planting. The garden is enclosed by boundary walls and mature screening, providing a pleasant and private outdoor space ideal for relaxing and outdoor entertaining.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\n\r\nBright and spacious three-bedroom semi-detached family home\r\nQuiet cul-de-sac location\r\nHighly sought-after Seabury development\r\nMain bedroom with en-suite, fully tiled, new suite\r\nGuest W.C., fully tiled, new suite\r\nFamily bathroom, fully tiled, new suite\r\nOil-fired central heating\r\nFully fitted modern kitchen, separate utility\r\nLandscaped rear garden\r\nDouble-glazed uPVC windows\r\nConvenient to Malahide Village\r\nExcellent schools and local amenities nearby\r\nEasy access to DART, Dublin Airport, M1 and M50\r\n\r\nVIEWING\r\nBy appointment with Redmond Property\r\nContact Niamh Jones MIPAV"
      },
